WEBVTT

00:00:03.430 --> 00:00:06.430
I hate you…

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:10.740
I hate you!

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:15.120
Shizuka!

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:19.450
Ryo-sama!

00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:29.420
Awright!

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:34.430
The bright sun is blessing the beginning of a new day.

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:38.930
Even the bitterly cold wind that caresses my cheek feels good to me now.

00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:41.390
It’s been a few days since Shizuka left.

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:44.940
I’ve been enjoying this
inexplicable freedom.

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:47.810
Peace is wonderful!

00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:51.950
I didn’t know the sky was so blue!

00:01:05.170 --> 00:01:10.380
So I don’t spill my wish from my eyes,

00:01:11.220 --> 00:01:17.250
I want to make my heart race to you.

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:24.610
I put my feelings on this palette of endearment

00:01:31.150 --> 00:01:33.200
The sweetness

00:01:34.280 --> 00:01:38.240
and the strength you gave are sitting back to back.

00:01:38.240 --> 00:01:39.700
The time

00:01:41.460 --> 00:01:46.130
is drawing bells in the sky.

00:01:47.730 --> 00:01:54.260
Colorful assortments of balloons of dreams

00:01:54.260 --> 00:01:56.150
float in the wind,

00:01:56.150 --> 00:01:58.030
flowing toward you,

00:01:58.030 --> 00:02:01.500
and become the boat to our future.

00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:08.310
I’m happy that I found destiny.

00:02:08.310 --> 00:02:11.940
It’s filling with colors.

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:17.950
“Idiot” of Love and Blessing!
Great Applause!!

00:02:22.190 --> 00:02:25.820
It’s gotten lonely, don’t you think?

00:02:25.820 --> 00:02:27.290
Especially around here.

00:02:27.820 --> 00:02:30.870
What you miss are the extravagant lunches she made.

00:02:30.870 --> 00:02:34.300
You know, it was just abnormal eating such lunches every day.

00:02:34.660 --> 00:02:39.220
I don’t care! I just miss her lunches!

00:02:39.750 --> 00:02:41.250
Don’t give me that attitude!

00:02:41.250 --> 00:02:44.380
Her existence here was unnatural to start with!

00:02:44.380 --> 00:02:47.730
She and I really shouldn’t have met under normal circumstances.

00:02:47.730 --> 00:02:50.800
If you go that far, then let me tell you something too.

00:02:50.800 --> 00:02:52.930
What about our feelings,

00:02:52.930 --> 00:02:57.240
having to be separated without being able to say goodbye?!

00:02:57.980 --> 00:02:59.240
Well…

00:03:01.190 --> 00:03:06.570
Anyway, it’s no use thinking about someone who isn’t here anymore.

00:03:06.570 --> 00:03:07.290
I’m done!

00:03:07.860 --> 00:03:11.190
“It’s no use thinking about someone who isn’t here anymore.”

00:03:11.730 --> 00:03:13.880
You can’t be serious.

00:03:31.470 --> 00:03:33.680
That was fun, wasn’t it?

00:03:33.680 --> 00:03:35.400
Also, there was something else.

00:03:39.390 --> 00:03:43.990
Shizuka onee-sama, please get well soon.

00:03:44.900 --> 00:03:46.610
There she is.

00:03:47.570 --> 00:03:48.500
We made it.

00:03:49.360 --> 00:03:52.280
Shizuka-chan, this is from all of us.

00:03:52.280 --> 00:03:54.160
Cheer up, Shizuka-chan.

00:03:54.160 --> 00:03:56.660
Don’t stay so depressed.

00:03:57.540 --> 00:04:00.000
Thank you very much, everyone.

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:03.420
I’m fine now.

00:04:03.420 --> 00:04:04.670
See you later.

00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:09.340
Shizuka onee-sama is trying to act tough.

00:04:09.340 --> 00:04:11.550
Even though she said she’s fine…

00:04:14.350 --> 00:04:16.820
With that thing…

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:26.660
We finally became friends!

00:04:27.510 --> 00:04:29.660
You can’t be serious.

00:04:33.160 --> 00:04:34.200
Ryo-sama.

00:04:53.510 --> 00:04:54.440
Welcome.

00:04:55.390 --> 00:04:56.850
Please take the table in the back.

00:04:57.440 --> 00:04:59.440
Yes, thank you for your order.

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:02.120
Thank you very much.

00:05:13.360 --> 00:05:14.460
Ryo-kun, you’re acting strange.

00:05:16.280 --> 00:05:17.630
Strange? How?

00:05:18.160 --> 00:05:20.250
Don’t play dumb.

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:21.930
I can see that you’re just
trying to act happy.

00:05:22.580 --> 00:05:24.580
I’m not trying!

00:05:24.580 --> 00:05:28.170
I just can’t sit still!

00:05:28.170 --> 00:05:31.390
My body just wants to move!

00:05:31.970 --> 00:05:33.630
R-Really?

00:05:36.260 --> 00:05:39.010
You’re finally free from that wench,

00:05:39.010 --> 00:05:41.030
and you’re enjoying your freedom.

00:05:41.720 --> 00:05:46.280
Well, it’s true, but let’s not speak badly about someone who’s not here, Haru.

00:05:47.630 --> 00:05:49.940
That’s what you always said.

00:05:49.940 --> 00:05:53.790
Nasty, no common sense, crazy, mean…

00:05:54.240 --> 00:05:55.660
I know.

00:05:55.660 --> 00:06:00.280
But talking like that when she’s not here, is… like…

00:06:00.280 --> 00:06:03.160
Besides, she is…

00:06:05.210 --> 00:06:06.420
Ryo-kun…

00:06:27.480 --> 00:06:28.810
Welcome home, Brother.

00:06:28.830 --> 00:06:30.570
It was still cold out there, wasn’t it?

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:31.820
Would you like some coffee?

00:06:31.820 --> 00:06:32.440
Sure.

00:06:43.700 --> 00:06:46.290
Good morning, Ryo-sama.

00:06:46.290 --> 00:06:49.420
Ryo-sama, dinner is ready.

00:06:49.420 --> 00:06:52.000
Jeez, Ryo-sama!

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:52.800
Ryo-sama.

00:06:53.130 --> 00:06:55.930
Ryo-sama!

00:06:55.930 --> 00:06:59.010
Brother, coffee is ready.

00:06:59.010 --> 00:07:00.820
Thank you, Shizuka.

00:07:02.640 --> 00:07:05.640
What was that?!

00:07:05.640 --> 00:07:06.700
Sorry, Akane!

00:07:08.440 --> 00:07:11.150
You don’t have to be so embarrassed.

00:07:11.980 --> 00:07:14.360
Have it before it gets cold, Brother.

00:07:17.490 --> 00:07:19.460
Oh, man…

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:28.460
Jeez…

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:35.470
You’re still causing trouble even after you’ve gone.

00:07:36.880 --> 00:07:38.310
Owwww!

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:41.850
That hurts, Ryo-sama!

00:07:42.220 --> 00:07:45.020
Oh, right, sorry, sorry.

00:07:45.890 --> 00:07:48.640
Man, I must sound like I’m crazy.

00:07:52.860 --> 00:07:53.870
What’s…

00:08:08.410 --> 00:08:09.830
Ryo-sama,

00:08:09.830 --> 00:08:10.800
thank you.

00:08:13.210 --> 00:08:14.210
Ryo-sama,

00:08:16.130 --> 00:08:17.250
thank you.

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:21.430
Why…

00:08:22.470 --> 00:08:24.680
How could you…

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:29.070
I’ve never done…

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:34.030
anything to be thanked for…

00:08:35.610 --> 00:08:38.270
Not only that, I…

00:08:39.190 --> 00:08:39.790
I…

00:08:41.400 --> 00:08:43.410
I was stubborn until the end,

00:08:44.160 --> 00:08:46.660
and to you… I…

00:08:47.660 --> 00:08:48.350
I…

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:50.800
Ryo-sama,
thank you.

00:08:51.580 --> 00:08:53.790
I’m a fool.

00:08:56.920 --> 00:09:01.970
Shizuka…

00:09:03.110 --> 00:09:04.270
Shizuka!

00:09:05.180 --> 00:09:06.110
Ryo-sama!

00:09:08.670 --> 00:09:09.700
Ryo-sama.

00:09:11.020 --> 00:09:12.060
Ryo-sama!

00:09:20.110 --> 00:09:21.290
What?!

00:09:25.590 --> 00:09:27.300
What was that?

00:09:27.300 --> 00:09:29.330
Akane!

00:09:29.330 --> 00:09:30.590
Brother?!

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:33.080
Akane, I have something I need to do.

00:09:33.080 --> 00:09:35.090
I’m going to skip school tomorrow.

00:09:35.580 --> 00:09:37.630
Skip school?

00:09:38.670 --> 00:09:40.270
You mean, you’ll…

00:09:41.460 --> 00:09:42.140
Yeah.

00:10:03.780 --> 00:10:06.770
So I don’t spill my wish
from my eyes,

00:10:06.770 --> 00:10:08.120
Good morning, Kane-chan.

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:08.880
Where’s Ryo?

00:10:09.160 --> 00:10:09.880
He’s not coming today, he has something important to do.

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:12.370
I want to make my heart
race to you

00:10:12.370 --> 00:10:14.160
Something important?

00:10:14.160 --> 00:10:15.880
You mean, that idiot is…

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:17.380
Yeah!

00:10:17.380 --> 00:10:19.540
I put my feelings on this
palette of endearment
Yay, Kane-chan!

00:10:19.540 --> 00:10:20.960
I’m so happy!

00:10:20.960 --> 00:10:21.390
Yeah!

00:10:21.390 --> 00:10:22.130
I put my feelings on this
palette of endearment

00:10:22.130 --> 00:10:23.200
What? Mizuhara did?

00:10:23.200 --> 00:10:24.130
and paint the feelings
on my heart

00:10:24.130 --> 00:10:27.550
Yeah! He went to see Shizuka-chan!

00:10:27.550 --> 00:10:28.470
Really?

00:10:28.470 --> 00:10:28.770
Yeah.

00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:29.080
and paint the feelings
on my heart

00:10:29.880 --> 00:10:30.100
The sweetness

00:10:30.100 --> 00:10:32.760
So, that idiot Mizuhara finally went.

00:10:32.760 --> 00:10:33.280
and the strength you gave
are sitting back to back

00:10:33.280 --> 00:10:35.180
What now, Emi-rin?

00:10:35.180 --> 00:10:36.850
It’s the comeback of your rival in love.

00:10:36.850 --> 00:10:37.780
Sparkling,
Give me a break!

00:10:37.780 --> 00:10:38.580
Sparkling,

00:10:40.050 --> 00:10:44.790
the bells of our vows
hang in the sky

00:10:46.420 --> 00:10:53.300
Colorful balloon
assortments of dreams

00:10:53.300 --> 00:10:54.880
float in the wind

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:56.730
flowing toward you

00:10:56.730 --> 00:10:59.800
and become the boat to our future

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:02.800
I’m happy that I found destiny
SANYO GIRLS SCHOOL

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:06.810
I’m happy that I found destiny

00:11:06.810 --> 00:11:10.820
It’s filling with colors

00:11:20.930 --> 00:11:24.230
Look straight at me,

00:11:24.230 --> 00:11:26.370
so the image won’t be fuzzy

00:11:26.900 --> 00:11:33.100
But I suddenly get uneasy. Why?

00:11:34.590 --> 00:11:38.300
All the words passing by,

00:11:38.300 --> 00:11:40.300
where are they hurrying to?

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:47.080
The meaning of these
painful questions

00:11:47.080 --> 00:11:48.920
Over the passage of time,

00:11:49.980 --> 00:11:53.970
I wave goodbye to my
boastfulness and weakness

00:11:53.970 --> 00:11:55.840
No matter when,

00:11:57.160 --> 00:12:02.140
I can keep trying
as long as you are beside me

00:12:03.470 --> 00:12:10.190
Always stay by my side,
so I don’t break

00:12:10.190 --> 00:12:11.970
Hold me

00:12:11.970 --> 00:12:13.840
I want to

00:12:13.840 --> 00:12:17.200
be colored in you

00:12:17.200 --> 00:12:24.120
Just like whispering
“Love to you”

00:12:24.120 --> 00:12:28.250
Let’s walk together

00:12:29.470 --> 00:12:53.000
Ryo-sama!

00:12:56.670 --> 00:13:03.360
Colorful balloon
assortments of dreams

00:13:03.360 --> 00:13:05.080
float in the wind

00:13:05.080 --> 00:13:06.980
flowing toward you

00:13:06.980 --> 00:13:10.390
and become the boat to our future

00:13:10.390 --> 00:13:17.250
Just like whispering
“Love to you”

00:13:17.250 --> 00:13:21.610
We’ll be together forever

00:13:24.230 --> 00:13:27.320
My name is Masuda Shizuka.

00:13:27.320 --> 00:13:31.490
As incompetent as I am,
do not think poorly of me.

00:13:32.410 --> 00:13:33.620
There’s still a little more of the story after this.

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:35.500
To be continued

00:13:36.990 --> 00:13:40.030
The moment came

00:13:40.870 --> 00:13:44.030
very much out of the blue.

00:13:45.270 --> 00:13:49.170
You showed up right in front of me,

00:13:49.170 --> 00:13:51.890
then started to change everything.

00:13:52.900 --> 00:13:55.720
If my meeting you

00:13:56.620 --> 00:13:59.570
is not by fate,

00:14:00.920 --> 00:14:04.930
there are no miracles,

00:14:04.930 --> 00:14:10.120
even if I search all over the world.

00:14:10.320 --> 00:14:13.510
Embracing love,

00:14:14.320 --> 00:14:17.440
kissing love,

00:14:18.190 --> 00:14:21.370
holding love,

00:14:21.870 --> 00:14:25.710
I whisper, “I love you.”

00:14:25.710 --> 00:14:29.700
Please look at me and me alone,

00:14:29.700 --> 00:14:33.120
forever.

00:14:37.090 --> 00:14:39.970
Good afternoon, everyone. Shizuka here.

00:14:39.970 --> 00:14:42.250
This time, the story got too serious,

00:14:42.250 --> 00:14:45.450
so we couldn’t add a DVD bonus scene. I’m so sorry!

00:14:46.260 --> 00:14:49.890
To make up for it,
I’ll screen a treasured video of myself.

00:14:49.890 --> 00:14:53.160
Hey! You don’t get to decide if it’s “treasured”!

00:14:53.750 --> 00:14:59.140
While relaxing comfortably
on the futon, I accidentally fell asleep.

00:14:59.140 --> 00:15:03.520
And Akane-san filmed me. How embarrassing.

00:15:03.520 --> 00:15:05.750
And so, I wish you well.
